  (text "What this does: Measures acceleration beyond the low-g IMUs' range, using the ADXL375.\nConnects to: Flight MCU SPI and data-ready pins -> this high-g sensor. Fed from FLIGHT_3V3 through R3301, a 47 ohm link (D-6.6, D-2Nov.3)."
